            <ArticleTitle>Calvarial tuberculosis: an unusual presentation (2007: 8b).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3014-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of calvarial tuberculosis with an associated extra-dural collection. This presentation has rarely been reported in the literature and the magnetic resonance imaging features are not well documented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
